SELECT INTERVAL '1' YEAR AS y,INTERVAL '2' MONTH AS m,INTERVAL '3' DAY AS d,INTERVAL '4' HOUR AS h,INTERVAL '5' MINUTE AS min,INTERVAL '6.1234567899' SECOND AS s;
SELECT INTERVAL '1-2' YEAR TO MONTH AS ym,INTERVAL '1 2' DAY TO HOUR AS dh,INTERVAL '1 2:3' DAY TO MINUTE AS dm,INTERVAL '1 2:3:4.123456789' DAY TO SECOND AS ds,INTERVAL '1:2' HOUR TO MINUTE AS hm,INTERVAL '1:2:3.123456789' HOUR TO SECOND AS hs,INTERVAL '1:2.123456789' MINUTE TO SECOND AS ms;
SELECT INTERVAL '-0' DAY AS zero,INTERVAL -'-0.1' SECOND AS positive,INTERVAL '-0.1' SECOND AS negative;
SELECT INTERVAL '1' DAY TO SECOND AS d,INTERVAL '1 2' DAY TO SECOND AS h,INTERVAL '1 2:3' DAY TO SECOND AS m;
SELECT INTERVAL '1.' SECOND AS bad;
SELECT INTERVAL '1-12' YEAR TO MONTH AS bad;
SELECT INTERVAL '1 24' DAY TO HOUR AS bad;
SELECT INTERVAL '1:60' HOUR TO MINUTE AS bad;
SELECT INTERVAL '1 2:3:60' DAY TO SECOND AS bad;
SELECT INTERVAL '1000000000000000000' DAY AS bad;
SELECT INTERVAL '100' DAY(2) AS bad;
SELECT INTERVAL '1.999999999' SECOND(2,0);
SELECT CAST('1.999999999' AS INTERVAL SECOND);
SELECT CAST(INTERVAL '-10' YEAR AS INTERVAL MONTH(3)),CAST(INTERVAL '-20' MONTH AS INTERVAL YEAR),CAST(INTERVAL '-20' MONTH AS INTERVAL YEAR TO MONTH);
SELECT CAST(INTERVAL '-93784.123456789' SECOND AS INTERVAL DAY TO HOUR);
SELECT CAST('INTERVAL ''1-6'' YEAR TO MONTH' AS INTERVAL MONTH);
SELECT CAST(INTERVAL '1' YEAR AS INTERVAL DAY) AS bad;
SELECT CAST('INTERVAL ''1'' YEAR' AS INTERVAL DAY) AS bad;
SELECT CAST(1.5 AS INTERVAL YEAR TO MONTH),CAST(-1.5 AS INTERVAL YEAR),CAST(1.5 AS INTERVAL DAY TO SECOND);
SELECT CAST(-0.5 AS INTERVAL YEAR) AS d,CAST(CAST(-0.5 AS DOUBLE) AS INTERVAL YEAR) AS f;
SELECT CAST(INTERVAL '1-6' YEAR TO MONTH AS INT) AS i,CAST(INTERVAL '1-6' YEAR TO MONTH AS NUMERIC(10,4)) AS n;
SELECT CAST(INTERVAL '99.999999999' SECOND AS INTERVAL SECOND) AS bad;
SELECT CAST(INTERVAL '999999999999999999.999999999' SECOND AS INTERVAL SECOND(18)) AS last;
CREATE TABLE bad(i INTERVAL DAY(0));
CREATE TABLE bad(i INTERVAL DAY(19));
CREATE TABLE bad(i INTERVAL SECOND(2,10));
SELECT INTERVAL '1' YEAR=INTERVAL '12' MONTH AS ym,INTERVAL '1' DAY=INTERVAL '24' HOUR AS dt,INTERVAL '1' DAY='1' AS text;
SELECT INTERVAL '1' YEAR=INTERVAL '1' DAY AS bad;
SELECT INTERVAL '1' DAY=1 AS bad;
SELECT INTERVAL '1' YEAR AS i UNION SELECT INTERVAL '12' MONTH;
SELECT INTERVAL '1' DAY AS i UNION SELECT 1;
SELECT COALESCE(CAST(NULL AS INTERVAL HOUR),INTERVAL '1' DAY) AS i;
SELECT ABS(INTERVAL '-1' DAY) AS positive;
SELECT ROW(INTERVAL '1' YEAR) AS i UNION SELECT INTERVAL '12' MONTH;
SELECT INTERVAL '1' DAY+INTERVAL '1' HOUR AS added,INTERVAL '1' YEAR/2 AS divided,INTERVAL '-0.000000003' SECOND*0.5 AS scaled;
SELECT INTERVAL '1' SECOND/3 AS bad;
SELECT INTERVAL '1' SECOND/0 AS bad;
SELECT INTERVAL '1' SECOND/INTERVAL '0' SECOND AS bad;
SELECT INTERVAL '1' DAY*CAST(1E999 AS DOUBLE) AS bad;
SELECT CAST(CAST(1E999 AS DOUBLE) AS INTERVAL YEAR) AS bad;
SELECT INTERVAL '1' DAY/INTERVAL '1' HOUR AS ratio;
SELECT DATE '2000-01-10'+INTERVAL '30' HOUR AS d,TIMESTAMP '2000-01-31 12:00:00'+INTERVAL '1' MONTH AS ts,TIME '10:00:00'-INTERVAL '30' MINUTE AS t;
SELECT TIME '23:00:00'+INTERVAL '2' HOUR AS bad;
SELECT DATE '2010-01-15'-DATE '2009-12-31' AS d,TIME '10:30:15.123456789'-TIME '11:00:00' AS t,TIMESTAMP '2010-01-15 12:00:00.5'-TIMESTAMP '2010-01-13 01:30:00' AS ts;
SELECT (DATE '2001-02-01'-DATE '2000-01-01') YEAR AS y,(TIMESTAMP '2000-01-02 01:00:00'-TIMESTAMP '2000-01-01 00:00:00') HOUR(3) AS h;
SELECT (10-2) SECOND AS bad;
SELECT (INTERVAL '10' HOUR-INTERVAL '1' HOUR) HOUR AS bad;
SELECT INTERVAL '1' DAY HOUR AS h,'2' DAY AS d;
SELECT EXTRACT(day FROM INTERVAL '-1 2:3:4.123456789' DAY TO SECOND) AS d,EXTRACT(hour FROM INTERVAL '-1 2:3:4.123456789' DAY TO SECOND) AS h,EXTRACT(minute FROM INTERVAL '-1 2:3:4.123456789' DAY TO SECOND) AS m,EXTRACT(second FROM INTERVAL '-1 2:3:4.123456789' DAY TO SECOND) AS s,EXTRACT(nanosecond FROM INTERVAL '-1 2:3:4.123456789' DAY TO SECOND) AS ns;
SELECT EXTRACT(epoch FROM INTERVAL '1' YEAR) AS y,EXTRACT(epoch FROM INTERVAL '1' MONTH) AS m,EXTRACT(epoch FROM INTERVAL '-0.000000001' SECOND) AS s;
SELECT EXTRACT(second FROM INTERVAL '-10000000000.000000001' SECOND) AS wrapped;
SELECT EXTRACT(quarter FROM INTERVAL '1' YEAR) AS bad;
SELECT SUM(i) AS sum_i,AVG(i) AS avg_i,MIN(i) AS min_i,MAX(i) AS max_i FROM (VALUES INTERVAL '1' DAY,INTERVAL '2' DAY) t(i);
SELECT SUM(i) AS bad FROM (VALUES INTERVAL '999999999999999999' YEAR,INTERVAL '1' YEAR,INTERVAL '-1' YEAR) t(i);
CREATE TABLE intervals(id INT PRIMARY KEY,i INTERVAL DAY(5) TO SECOND(9) UNIQUE,j INTERVAL YEAR TO MONTH DEFAULT INTERVAL '1-6' YEAR TO MONTH);
INSERT INTO intervals(id,i) VALUES(1,INTERVAL '-1 2:3:4.123456789' DAY TO SECOND),(2,INTERVAL '1' DAY),(3,NULL);
TABLE intervals ORDER BY i NULLS LAST;
SELECT CASE WHEN id=1 THEN i ELSE INTERVAL '1' HOUR END AS i FROM intervals ORDER BY id;
INSERT INTO intervals VALUES(4,INTERVAL '24' HOUR,INTERVAL '2' YEAR);
SELECT DISTINCT j FROM intervals;
SELECT j,COUNT(*) AS n FROM intervals GROUP BY j;
CREATE TABLE row_intervals AS SELECT ROW(INTERVAL '1-6' YEAR TO MONTH,INTERVAL '0.000000001' SECOND) AS pair;
TABLE row_intervals;
CREATE TABLE interval_defaults(i INTERVAL DAY TO SECOND DEFAULT (SELECT MAX(i) FROM intervals),d INTERVAL YEAR TO MONTH DEFAULT ((SELECT MAX(DATE '2000-02-01') FROM intervals)-DATE '1999-01-01') YEAR TO MONTH);
INSERT INTO interval_defaults DEFAULT VALUES;
UPDATE intervals SET i=i+INTERVAL '1' HOUR WHERE id=2;
INSERT INTO interval_defaults DEFAULT VALUES;
TABLE interval_defaults ORDER BY i;
WITH q(i) AS (SELECT i FROM intervals WHERE i IS NOT NULL) SELECT SUM(i) AS total FROM q;
DROP TABLE interval_defaults,row_intervals,intervals;
